title "Eight different labels"
idp [key]: Identity provider
a [globe]: Web
b [smartphone]: Mobile
c [package]: Orders
d [credit-card]: Billing
e [truck]: Shipping
f [bell]: Notify
a -> idp : login
b -> idp : refresh
c -> idp : validate orders
d -> idp : validate billing
e -> idp : validate shipping
f -> idp : validate notify
